5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I feel like we’re freezing in here. Can we talk about heating costs?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I need to see the actual numbers before we agree to anything new.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I worry about who has to do the math every single month.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,The old split was for three people. It’s outdated. Let’s fix it.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I want to address how these bills are affecting our communication lately.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,@Shunichi I agree. But I also want to make sure no one is left shivering.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio Comfort is important, but I need to know the baseline first.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji I can help with the math, but I don’t want it to be my job.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,@Rin I’ll handle the analysis. I just need the right data points.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin I appreciate your offer. Let’s keep the tone gentle, though.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I’m worried about the winter months specifically. It gets so cold.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I’ve been setting aside money, but the bills keep changing. It’s unpredictable.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,"If we use a template, maybe it will be faster and less stressful for everyone.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,Predictability is key. I want to see where the money actually goes.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,Stress is real. I’ve noticed people avoiding each other after bill reminders.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,Let’s look into the heating needs and the recent statements.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will check the payment log and the electrician’s quote.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I want to see the trial run of the reconciliation template.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll look at the plug-in monitor readings and the last twelve statements.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I want to see the kitchen notice and the winter habits at another house.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
