60,3,1,talk,Mio,,Option A sounds the most peaceful. I don’t want to think about bills every month.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Option B is the most accurate, but the upfront cost is a barrier. I need to weigh that.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Rin,,Option A means I don’t have to do the math. I like that. But is it fair?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option B is the only one that reflects the data I have. The others are guesses.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Option A stops the arguments. I’ve seen it work elsewhere. I think it’s the kindest.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi I know B is accurate, but I’m tired of the stress. A feels safer.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio I understand. But if the winter bill spikes, A could leave us short. I need to see the numbers.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji If A is short, we just split the difference. It’s not a big deal.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,@Rin It is a big deal if one person is using four times the energy. A hides that.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Misaki,,@Shunichi It hides the friction. I’d rather hide the friction than the cost.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,"I’m leaning toward A. It makes the house feel like a home, not a business.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I’m still on the fence. The quote for B is high, but the payment log shows A could cause late payments.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Rin,,I’m voting for A. I don’t want to be the one doing the reconciliation.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I’m voting for B. It’s the only honest way. I’ll handle the calculations.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I’m voting for A. It protects our relationships. That’s what matters most.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mio,,I hope we can all agree on A. It feels right for us.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,I’ll think about it. But I’m worried about the winter spike. I might vote B.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Rin,,I’m definitely A. I want my evenings back.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll stick with B. Accuracy matters. I can’t ignore the data.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Misaki,,I’ll stick with A. Kindness matters more than precision here.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
